quectel-qmi-go provenance and licensing status
===============================================

This directory contains a vendored copy of the QMI package used by Vocat.

Upstream source repository:
  https://github.com/cm9vdA/quectel-qmi-go

Imported upstream commit:
  a513430381a33f493e32f7bb7b96e2450a403643

The upstream commit is authored by iniwex5 (iniwex@qq.com). The Go module
path retained by this vendored copy is github.com/iniwex5/quectel-qmi-go.

Local changes made after import:
  * pkg/qmi/errors.go: corrected the QMI error-number mapping used by Vocat.
  * pkg/qmi/wms.go: added WMS reset, subscription-binding, readiness, and
    route constants used by Vocat's SMS recovery path.

